			"Message": "docs(Wind): Update documentation links to use Editor.Land domain capitalization\n\nChange the four documentation links in the See Also section from lowercase `editor.land` to properly capitalized `Editor.Land` domain format. The affected links are Wind Documentation, Architecture Overview, Why Effect-TS, and Why Tauri.\n\nThis aligns the README references with the project's official domain branding while preserving all link destinations and functionality.",
