				2000,
				300
			],
			"Message": "build(Wind): Reformat ESBuild configs and simplify reactive layers\n\nReformat all ESBuild configuration files (BaseConfig, CompileConfig, TargetConfig, Wind.js, Target.js, index.js, and constants) to compact single-line format, removing expanded multi-line formatting from the previous codegen completion commit.\n\nSimplify PanelLive, SidebarLive, StatusBarLive, and TelemetryLive layers to use plain mutable state with direct Stream.empty references instead of Effect-TS SubscriptionRef and Stream.empty() calls, removing reactive overhead while preserving identical APIs.\n\nUpdate CommandCatalog.ts with regenerated upstream command registrations (551 total) and refresh all generated service interfaces under Source/Effect/Generated/ to align with current VS Code upstream sources.\n\nClean up bridge shape global type definitions (UserSettings, WorkbenchActivity, WorkbenchClipboard, WorkbenchCommand, WorkbenchContextKey, WorkbenchDialog, WorkbenchEditor, WorkbenchExtension, WorkbenchHost, WorkbenchKeybinding, WorkbenchLifecycle, WorkbenchNotification, WorkbenchProduct, WorkbenchProgress, WorkbenchStorage, WorkbenchWorkspace) by removing unnecessary blank lines in type declarations.\n\nImpact: Reduces configuration file verbosity, eliminates reactive subscription overhead in core UI layers, and ensures generated service interfaces reflect latest upstream definitions.",
			"SHA": "1a05b4c84dbd063906b22e199a67581a1910f533"
		}
